  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LEGAL SUPPORT PROGRAMME</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) To help grass roots communities and organisations working in the field of legal aid to develop alternative use of the law

2) to encourage research on existing manifestations of informal law - including common usage and community lawmaking - in an attempt to provide responses to daily practical problems of justice and seek to identify and use law to bring positive benefits to the community

3) To support PAJ target groups and partners develop ways of improving participation in society and contribute to the transition from the current legal system to practical ways fo exercising alternative law.</narrative>
  </description>
